  "notes": "Scoped T4 exact/analytic reduction plus executed adversarial diagnostics. A13-CLASSII-HESSIAN-DIFFERENCE-SAFE-PACKET-DOOB-BRACKET-REDUCTION (R-078) replaces the globally nonoptimal cubic coordinate by an exact bounded Hessian difference with A^2 DA payload, improving the comparable payment from moment 15 to 30/7. Canonical subtraction from the complete endpoint repairs the descriptive R-077 packet list. For factorised bilinear components, one causal projection identifies the future-control innovation-bracket mechanism; its unweighted coefficient coordinate is one-use in Hilbert square function, while the declared R-050 high-U principal costs moment 60/19. Pre-release audit AUDIT-2026-07-25-A13-R078-PRE-RELEASE-PACKET-TO-BRACKET-ATTRIBUTION records that the exact full packet-to-bracket decomposition and complete low-end absorption remain in the successor gate. Termwise absolute A-high summation and automatic bracket-plus-square positivity are recorded as method no-gos, not production counterexamples. Primary 33/33, non-importing independent 24/24, integrated 176/176, and aggregate 233/233 pass. The final nine-page PDF was rebuilt with zero overfull boxes, rendered at 150 dpi, and visually checked on every page. T-050 remains in progress at the exact packet reconstruction, weighted innovation bracket, controlled-shell one-use, and Nelson synthesis. Tier stays T4."
